BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 493.77 Tm (The dirt itself kills more deals than any negotiation. Ron Apke names soil as the main fallout point: with no city sewer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.55 Tm (or water, a property needs well and septic, and about 5% of deals die when the land fails the percolation test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.32 Tm ([Z_ZynszdCFo @ 00:05:02]. Thomas says soils have "killed more of my deals than anything," after paying about $600) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.10 Tm (per test, and now pushes that verification onto the buyer during the inspection period [ZfyoS572Kbk @ 01:37:27].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.87 Tm (Landon Bleau ran an 18% fallout rate in 2024 while skipping perc tests, surveys, and title commitments, a shortcut that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 417.65 Tm (only held while properties were going under contract within 48 hours [Uaqe67xWZN0 @ 00:23:09]. Zoning text is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 402.42 Tm (quieter trap. Alex Reese's worst deal was seven non-conforming lots in Bladen County bought for about $36K, all-in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.20 Tm (about $40K, where a contiguity clause in the zoning ordinance allowed only 3 homes; the land sold for about $47K and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.97 Tm (netted roughly $300 [iC5tSNnegIw @ 00:55:20]. Wetlands, floodways, slope, and access that only looks real round out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 356.75 Tm (the list, and the operators still standing treat every cheap parcel as guilty until the soil, the ordinance, and the road) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 341.52 Tm (frontage clear.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.30 Tm (Capital and hold time form the second failure cluster. Landon Bleau self-funded purchases expecting four-week resales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.07 Tm (and watched them take four months, locking up cash until moving to 4 lenders with $800K to $1M in liquidity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.85 Tm ([Uaqe67xWZN0 @ 00:53:04]. Bleau also admits to doubling mail and texting while adding cold calling and PPC in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.62 Tm (single month, having "optimized for gross profit, which was really stupid," and reports a $25K haircut when a $100K) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 265.40 Tm (listing sold at $75K. Alex Reese warns that roughly $20K of monthly overhead in payroll and mail can lose $15K to) Tj ET
