BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (tax history, balance and boundary coordinates. To find any county's map, Harris Googles the county, state and GIS,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (then tries portal, tax lot finder or zoning map [6qNh515jvww @ 00:06:16]. Josephine Saffert works the same way on) Tj ET
