BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (anything corporate and anyone who bought recently, then lean into distance and tenure. Great Lands LLC's PropStream) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (walk-through insists on unlisted property. It then filters for individual owners who have held at least 10 years, people) Tj ET
